*Blocker:* a path in the new commit other than the guard; the revert not byte-equal to the inverse of `895417a3`; the guard blob not main's; a net delta beyond the three paths, or any tree difference between the merge result and main outside them; any non-deletion line in `backend/server.js`; a caller of the deleted name; a `merge-tree` conflict with current main or a merge-result tree that differs from GitHub's; a red cell at the merge result that is not main's own flake (Check 3); a count other than 5005/305 equal to the committed file, or a cell added or lost; a NEW CodeQL alert of security severity high+ or rule severity `error`, or a CodeQL check-run concluded failure; a gitleaks finding; a person name, decision-card id or secret in the new commit's message or an added line; the head moved. *Major:* a builder claim contradicted by your measurement that changes the verdict's basis (a `Tests:` figure, the inverse claim, the net-delta claim); a Build run that checked out a merge sha other than the one you gated; a cell red for the wrong reason. *Minor/Note:* the PR title or body still claiming RD-844 (Tuesday's edit); the unsigned commit; B621-3/4/5/7 carried; the Build duration (60.6 min against 36.6 min); node version differing from CI; load-rule remarks; the history carrying the `895417a3`-and-revert pair.
